  "project_description": "This project allows adding alternate hreflang for external sites\n\n(not languages in Drupal).\n\n This project requires metatag project and to complete it just access your metatag configuration and you'll check a new field called \"External Hreflang\".\n\n Scenario: We have a site in Drupal for one country / market and it's other country sites are managed by different team or may it is separate Drupal installation.\n\n Site 1: US with languages EN, ES, FR\n\nSite 2: UK with language EN\n\nSite 3: FR with languages EN, FR\n\n Now if we want to add reference (hreflang) of FR of Site 3 in Site 1, this module is for you.",
